        "answer": {
          "short": "$5x$ counts blocks in five bags; $4$ counts four loose blocks. They are unlike terms, so $5x+4$ cannot simplify to $9x$.",
          "worked": "$9x$ represents nine bags containing $x$ blocks each. The diagram has five bags and four loose blocks. The terms $5x$ and $4$ are unlike terms and cannot be added to give $9x$.",
